---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "@/components/PageHero.astro";
import { config } from "@/lib/config";
---

<Base
  title="Hotel Property Management System"
  description="InnPilot PMS connects front desk, reservations, housekeeping, billing, and maintenance in one property management system for hotels and hospitality businesses."
  canonical="https://inn-pilot.com/features/pms/"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: "Home", item: config.seo.url },
    { name: "Platform", item: `${config.seo.url}/platform/` },
    { name: "PMS", item: `${config.seo.url}/features/pms/` },
  ]}
>

  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Property Management System"
    title="Run your property from one connected system."
    description="Front desk, reservations, housekeeping, guest profiles, billing, and maintenance — all in one place. No spreadsheets, no disconnected tools, no double entry."
    primaryCta={{ label: "Request Access", href: config.urls.requestAccess }}
    secondaryCta={{ label: "Explore Platform", href: "/platform/" }}
  />

  <!-- ── PMS Value Proposition ──────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="pmsv section" id="why-pms">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">Why InnPilot PMS</span>
        <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">One system for daily operations.</h2>
        <p class="reveal reveal-delay-2">
          Most properties juggle separate tools for front desk, housekeeping, billing, and guest management.
          InnPilot brings them together — so your team works from one record, not five.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pmsv__grid">
        <div class="pmsv__card reveal">
          <div class="pmsv__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <strong>One operational record</strong>
          <p>Every reservation, guest, charge, and housekeeping task lives in the same system — connected and current.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pmsv__card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="pmsv__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <strong>Front desk to back office</strong>
          <p>Check-ins, room assignments, housekeeping, and billing all flow through one connected workflow.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pmsv__card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="pmsv__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <strong>Faster daily workflows</strong>
          <p>Reduce manual handoffs. Your team spends less time on administration and more time on guests.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pmsv__card reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="pmsv__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <strong>Connected to selling and distribution</strong>
          <p>The PMS is the operational core — your booking engine and channel manager pull from the same live data.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Key PMS Capabilities ───────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="kpc section section--alt" id="capabilities">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">Key Capabilities</span>
        <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">Everything your property needs to operate.</h2>
        <p class="reveal reveal-delay-2">
          Built for the realities of hotel operations — from the front desk to housekeeping to the back office.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="kpc__grid">
        <div class="kpc__card reveal">
          <div class="kpc__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="kpc__title">Reservations &amp; Front Desk</h3>
          <p class="kpc__desc">
            Create, modify, and manage reservations. Handle arrivals, departures, walk-ins, and no-shows from a single front desk dashboard.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kpc__card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="kpc__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="kpc__title">Room Management</h3>
          <p class="kpc__desc">
            Manage room types, categories, buildings, and availability. A 17-state room status machine tracks every room from vacant-clean to occupied.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kpc__card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="kpc__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="kpc__title">Guest Profiles</h3>
          <p class="kpc__desc">
            Build rich guest profiles with identification, address, emergency contacts, preferences, and stay history — aggregated from across your operations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kpc__card reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="kpc__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="kpc__title">Housekeeping</h3>
          <p class="kpc__desc">
            Assign tasks, track room status, manage staff workload and shifts, conduct inspections, and handle lost &amp; found — all from one dashboard.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kpc__card reveal">
          <div class="kpc__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="1" y="4" width="22" height="16" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="1" y1="10" x2="23" y2="10"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="kpc__title">Billing &amp; Payments</h3>
          <p class="kpc__desc">
            Post charges, manage folios, generate invoices, and process payments — cash, card, UPI, bank transfer, or Stripe. Automatic tax calculation on every charge.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kpc__card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="kpc__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="kpc__title">Tax &amp; GST</h3>
          <p class="kpc__desc">
            India GST presets (18% standard, 12% budget), configurable tax rules, compound taxes, and exemption support. Nepal VAT, UAE VAT, and Sri Lanka VAT included.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kpc__card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="kpc__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="kpc__title">Night Audit</h3>
          <p class="kpc__desc">
            Automated 10-step nightly pipeline: post room charges, taxes, package charges, reconcile finances, generate reports, and close the business day.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kpc__card reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="kpc__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="kpc__title">Maintenance &amp; Service Requests</h3>
          <p class="kpc__desc">
            Track work orders, manage assets, and handle guest service requests — housekeeping, transport, wake-up calls, room service, and more.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── How It Works / Daily Operations Flow ──────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="hiw section" id="how-it-works">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">Daily Operations Flow</span>
        <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">From reservation to check-out, one connected flow.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="hiw__steps">
        <div class="hiw__step reveal">
          <div class="hiw__num" aria-hidden="true">1</div>
          <div class="hiw__content">
            <strong>Reservation comes in</strong>
            <p>From your booking engine, channel manager, walk-in, or phone — every reservation lands in the same system with guest details captured automatically.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw__step reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="hiw__num" aria-hidden="true">2</div>
          <div class="hiw__content">
            <strong>Arrival &amp; check-in</strong>
            <p>The front desk sees arrivals for the day. Assign rooms, create registration cards, and check guests in — with real-time room availability guiding the assignment.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw__step reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="hiw__num" aria-hidden="true">3</div>
          <div class="hiw__content">
            <strong>Room &amp; stay management</strong>
            <p>Handle room moves, upgrades, early check-ins, and late check-outs. Every change is reflected across the system instantly.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw__step reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="hiw__num" aria-hidden="true">4</div>
          <div class="hiw__content">
            <strong>Housekeeping &amp; operations</strong>
            <p>Tasks are assigned, room status updates in real time, inspections are tracked, and the housekeeping dashboard keeps everyone aligned.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw__step reveal">
          <div class="hiw__num" aria-hidden="true">5</div>
          <div class="hiw__content">
            <strong>Billing &amp; payment</strong>
            <p>Charges post to the folio automatically. Process payments by cash, card, UPI, or Stripe. Generate invoices with tax breakdowns ready for GST compliance.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw__step reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="hiw__num" aria-hidden="true">6</div>
          <div class="hiw__content">
            <strong>Check-out &amp; reporting</strong>
            <p>Settle the folio, check the guest out, and the room status updates automatically. Night audit runs the end-of-day pipeline and your operations are ready for tomorrow.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Connected System ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="cs section section--alt" id="connected">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">Connected System</span>
        <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">The operational core of your hospitality business.</h2>
        <p class="reveal reveal-delay-2">
          The PMS is where your operations live. Your booking engine and channel manager
          pull from the same data — so everything stays in sync.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cs__diagram reveal">
        <div class="cs__flow">
          <div class="cs__node cs__node--active">
            <div class="cs__node-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="cs__node-label">Operate</span>
            <span class="cs__node-sub">PMS</span>
          </div>

          <div class="cs__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 48" fill="none">
              <line x1="12" y1="0" x2="12" y2="48" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="24" r="4" fill="var(--color-accent)" stroke="none"/>
            </svg>
          </div>

          <a href="/features/booking-engine/" class="cs__node" data-track="pms_connects_booking_engine">
            <div class="cs__node-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M3 20h18"/><path d="M5 16l4-5 4 3 6-7"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="cs__node-label">Sell</span>
            <span class="cs__node-sub">Booking Engine</span>
          </a>

          <div class="cs__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 48" fill="none">
              <line x1="12" y1="0" x2="12" y2="48" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="24" r="4" fill="var(--color-accent)" stroke="none"/>
            </svg>
          </div>

          <a href="/features/channel-manager/" class="cs__node" data-track="pms_connects_channel_manager">
            <div class="cs__node-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M2 12h20"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="cs__node-label">Distribute</span>
            <span class="cs__node-sub">Channel Manager</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="cs__detail">
          <div class="cs__item reveal">
            <div class="cs__check" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
                <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="8" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <path d="M7 10l2 2 4-4" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Room availability is the single source of truth</strong>
              <p>Every channel — website, OTAs, walk-ins — sees the same live inventory from the PMS.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cs__item reveal reveal-delay-1">
            <div class="cs__check" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
                <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="8" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <path d="M7 10l2 2 4-4" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Online bookings appear in the PMS instantly</strong>
              <p>No manual re-entry. A confirmed booking on your website is visible at the front desk immediately.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cs__item reveal reveal-delay-2">
            <div class="cs__check" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
                <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="8" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <path d="M7 10l2 2 4-4" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Pricing changes propagate everywhere</strong>
              <p>Update a rate in the PMS — the booking engine and channel manager reflect it immediately.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cs__cta reveal">
        <a href="/platform/" class="btn btn--primary" data-track="pms_cta_platform">
          Explore the Full Platform
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M6 3l5 5-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Operational Benefits ────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="ob section" id="benefits">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">Operational Benefits</span>
        <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">Built for how properties actually operate.</h2>
        <p class="reveal reveal-delay-2">
          Not a generic tool adapted for hospitality. InnPilot's PMS is designed around the daily realities of running a property.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="ob__list">
        <div class="ob__item reveal">
          <div class="ob__num" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
          <div>
            <strong>One record across every department</strong>
            <p>Front desk, housekeeping, maintenance, and billing all work from the same data. No silos, no reconciliation headaches.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ob__item reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="ob__num" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Faster check-ins and check-outs</strong>
            <p>Room availability, guest history, and registration are at the front desk's fingertips. Walk-ins handled in seconds.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ob__item reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="ob__num" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Housekeeping stays in sync</strong>
            <p>Room status updates the moment a task is completed. Front desk always knows which rooms are ready for the next guest.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ob__item reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="ob__num" aria-hidden="true">04</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Billing you can trust</strong>
            <p>Automatic tax calculation, GST-ready invoicing, and multi-method payment processing — so every folio is accurate.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ob__item reveal">
          <div class="ob__num" aria-hidden="true">05</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Guest information, connected</strong>
            <p>Guest profiles pull from reservations, stays, folios, preferences, and communications — giving your team the full picture.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ob__item reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="ob__num" aria-hidden="true">06</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Night audit that runs itself</strong>
            <p>An automated 10-step pipeline handles end-of-day processing — charges, taxes, reconciliation, reports — while your team rests.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── FAQ ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="faq section section--alt" id="faq">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">Frequently Asked Questions</span>
        <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">Common questions about InnPilot PMS.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq__list">
        <details class="faq__item reveal">
          <summary class="faq__q">
            What is InnPilot PMS?
            <svg class="faq__chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M4 6l4 4 4-4"/>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq__a">
            <p>InnPilot PMS is a property management system that brings front desk, reservations, housekeeping, guest profiles, billing, and maintenance together in one connected platform. It is part of InnPilot's hospitality operating system, alongside the website booking engine and channel manager.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq__item reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <summary class="faq__q">
            What does the PMS manage?
            <svg class="faq__chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M4 6l4 4 4-4"/>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq__a">
            <p>The PMS manages reservations, room inventory, guest profiles, front desk operations (check-in, check-out, walk-ins), housekeeping tasks, maintenance work orders, billing and folios, payments, invoices, and night audit. It is the operational core of your property.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq__item reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <summary class="faq__q">
            Does InnPilot support housekeeping?
            <svg class="faq__chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M4 6l4 4 4-4"/>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq__a">
            <p>Yes. InnPilot includes full housekeeping management — task creation, staff assignment, room status tracking, shift management, room inspections, lost &amp; found, and a housekeeping dashboard. Staff can view their assigned tasks and update room status in real time.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq__item reveal">
          <summary class="faq__q">
            Does InnPilot support billing and payments?
            <svg class="faq__chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M4 6l4 4 4-4"/>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq__a">
            <p>Yes. The PMS includes folio management, invoice generation, and multi-method payment processing — cash, card, UPI, bank transfer, and Stripe. Charges post to folios automatically, and invoices include tax breakdowns with GST compliance for Indian properties.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq__item reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <summary class="faq__q">
            Is InnPilot GST-ready for Indian properties?
